---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contribution walkthrough">
  <article class="detail">
    <p class="eyebrow">FROM CONTRIBUTION TO EVIDENCE</p>
    <h1>Follow the work.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A genuine contribution should leave an inspectable trail.
    </p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h2>Propose an example</h2>
        <p>
          Open an issue with the language or format, expected behavior,
          requirements, and licensing.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Make a focused change</h2>
        <p>
          Add the sample and README, update its catalog record, and use a
          reviewed validation profile.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Run the checks</h2>
        <p>
          <code>npm run verify</code> checks the inventory, denial paths,
          samples, build, and local website links.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Review and merge</h2>
        <p>
          A reviewer checks correctness, licensing, and the limits of
          verification. A passing workflow is not a human review.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Publish and release</h2>
        <p>
          Pages publishes the merged commit. A tagged release can attach the
          catalog and evidence reports.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <section>
      <h2>The first implementation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/5675413-starfish-industries-5675413/github-showcase/pull/1">
            PR #1: pinned catalog and explorer
          </a>{' '}
          — merged.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/5675413-starfish-industries-5675413/github-showcase/actions/runs/42941104071">
            Main CI
          </a>{' '}
          — passed at <code>4b13cf9</code>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/5675413-starfish-industries-5675413/github-showcase/actions/runs/42941104081">
            Pages deployment
          </a>{' '}
          — succeeded at the same commit.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The public site's source links identify the deployed commit. No
        submitted human review, originating issue, or tagged release is recorded
        for this implementation.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="pending-panel">
      <h2>Traceable contribution: pending</h2>
      <p>
        The full issue → PR → human review → merge → deployment → release trail
        has not yet been recorded. The links above identify the steps that
        actually happened; the remaining steps are pending.
      </p>
      <a href="https://github.com/5675413-starfish-industries-5675413/github-showcase/pulls">
        Inspect actual pull requests ↗
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
